cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these numbers or charts, please cite token-tax."
title: "token-tax: what each language pays per tokenizer, priced"
abstract: >-
  Token premium versus English for 48 languages across 21 named LLM
  tokenizers, measured on the parallel FLORES-200 devtest set, and converted
  to dollars and effective context window with a dated price sheet.
type: dataset
